        "id": 1010681
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-24T09:53:09Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It depends how the tests are run - ART requires that you code must be in the same classloader (as well as package) to access package private code, and test code often has it\u0027s own classloader. I\u0027m not sure if that\u0027s the case here, but it\u0027s normal to make @VisibleForTesting things public like this.",
      "parentUuid": "1618c1cd_4a248bdf",
      "range": {
