        "id": 1431994
      },
      "writtenOn": "2019-06-21T15:31:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Is this really needed? From the documentation: \"The values corresponding to indices in ascending order are guaranteed to be associated with keys in ascending order, e.g., valueAt(0) will return the value associated with the smallest key and valueAt(size()-1) will return the value associated with the largest key.\"; and in addChange, the key corresponds to the change id.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 79,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 79,
        "endChar": 35
      },
      "revId": "030f2827947a7ecd49952942199d5d72ec2a9e54",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889",
      "unresolved": true
