      "writtenOn": "2019-06-24T09:59:12Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`disabled` is android.util.LongArray (and using .add should always append to the end); mChanges is a android.util.LongSparseArray and from the public documentation https://developer.android.com/reference/android/util/LongSparseArray , iterating thru it with valueAt should yield already sorted keys",
